// src/v4/test/claim/language_model/python_l1_static.dag
// Scope: PY-L1-STATIC-STRUCTURAL — pyright static structural analysis as a third,
//   distinct verification authority alongside CPython compile and runtime exec
//   (docs/planning/v4-python-rca-manager-worksheets-2026-06-01.md Worksheet A).
// Authority: Modeling DFS Arbiter ruling proud-fox-405 (msg_41813c03).
// Fixtures: src/v4/lens/leaf_model_verification.dag (python_l1_static_*).
